+To-Do v1.22.2 Self Test
+========================
+Base: v1.22.1 CompileFix
+Target: v1.22.2
+
+Focus of this release:
+- Note long-text input/delete must not write or restore scrollTop during typing.
+- Format toolbar is in editor flow and follows IME geometry.
+- Attachment/import/viewer features remain unchanged.
+
+Static checks performed in delivery environment:
+- script_0.js: node --check PASS
+- ui/todo.html == Android asset mirror PASS
+- inline main script == script_0.js PASS
+- static DOM IDs unique PASS
+- Android XML parse PASS
+- Locked reminder/banner/snooze files SHA-256 PASS
+- Existing business localStorage key literals unchanged vs v1.22.1 PASS
+- ZIP integrity test PASS
+
+Runtime checks still required on target phone:
+1. Open a long Note, scroll to the lower half, type continuously for at least 30 seconds.
+2. Backspace/delete repeatedly in the same lower paragraph.
+3. Tap several earlier/later caret positions. Current line must not jump to top.
+4. Show/hide keyboard repeatedly; toolbar must remain directly above keyboard.
+5. Scroll body with keyboard visible; toolbar must stay attached and root Note list must never appear.
+6. Verify image/file cards and attachment actions still work.
+
+Full Gradle build may be blocked in this sandbox if Gradle distribution download is unavailable; do not treat static checks as a full Android build.
